  "claim": "At the awards ceremony where Rudaali was selected as the Indian entry in 2000 for the Best Foreign Language Film but, was not accepted as a nominee, the awards for technical achievements were presented by host Laura Dern who was nominated for Best Actress for \"Rambling Rose\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: 66th Academy Awards. Sentence: Nearly a month earlier in a ceremony held at The Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills, California on February 26, the Academy Awards for Technical Achievement were presented by host Laura Dern.\nPage: Laura Dern. Sentence: For her performance in the 1991 film \"Rambling Rose\", she was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress, while for her performance in the 2014 film \"Wild\", she was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress.\nPage: Rudaali. Sentence: The film was selected as the Indian entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 66th Academy Awards, but was not accepted as a nominee.",
