        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Academy Awards ceremony, Best Foreign Language Film selection\n- Films: Rudaali, Rambling Rose\n- People: Laura Dern\n- Awards: Best Actress, technical achievement awards\n\nFacts:\n- Rudaali was selected as the Indian entry in 2000 for the Best Foreign Language Film category.\n- Rudaali was not accepted as a nominee for the Best Foreign Language Film category.\n- At the awards ceremony, Laura Dern presented the awards for technical achievements.\n- Laura Dern was the host at the awards ceremony.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for the Best Actress award for Rambling Rose.",
