        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "35441e77-020c-52b4-a1c6-a5b7b79e060e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 66th Academy Awards, Academy Awards for Technical Achievement\n- People: Laura Dern\n- Films: Rambling Rose, Wild, Rudaali\n- Places: The Beverly Hilton, Beverly Hills, California\n- Topics: Academy Award nominations, Best Foreign Language Film\n\nFacts:\n- On February 26, nearly a month before the 66th Academy Awards, the Academy Awards for Technical Achievement were presented at The Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills, California.\n- Laura Dern hosted the February 26 Academy Awards for Technical Achievement ceremony.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress for her performance in the 1991 film \"Rambling Rose.\"\n- Rudaali was selected as the Indian entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 66th Academy Awards, but Rudaali was not accepted as a nominee.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress for her performance in the 2014 film \"Wild.\"",
